    "Nothing answered. Check the address and that the computer is on. If it’s on another network, add a server in Settings › Server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing answered. Check the address and that the computer is on. If it’s on another network, add a server in Settings › Server."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es kam keine Antwort. Adresse prüfen und kontrollieren, ob der Computer eingeschaltet ist. Befindet er sich in einem anderen Netzwerk, unter „Einstellungen“ › „Server“ einen Server hinzufügen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "応答がありません。アドレスと、相手の電源が入っているかを確認してください。別のネットワークにある場合は、「設定」›「サーバー」でサーバーを追加します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有收到回应。请检查地址以及电脑是否已开机。如果它在其他网络中，请在“设置”›“服务器”中添加服务器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有收到回應。請檢查位址，並確認電腦已開機。如果它位於其他網路，請在「設定」›「伺服器」中新增伺服器。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "응답이 없습니다. 주소와 컴퓨터의 전원이 켜져 있는지 확인하세요. 다른 네트워크에 있다면 ‘설정’ › ‘서버’에서 서버를 추가하세요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No hubo respuesta. Comprueba la dirección y que el equipo esté encendido. Si está en otra red, añade un servidor en Ajustes › Servidor."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune réponse. Vérifiez l’adresse et que l’ordinateur est allumé. S’il se trouve sur un autre réseau, ajoutez un serveur dans Réglages › Serveur."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing answered. Check the address and that the computer is on. If it’s on another network, add a server in Settings › Server."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing answered. Check the address and that the computer is on. If it’s on another network, add a server in Settings › Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
